  (text "HAPTICS: DRV2605L drives an 8 mm LRA from +3V3 (kept powered; EN low gives microamp shutdown and keeps the shared I2C bus unloaded).\nR4 holds EN low while the MCU is in reset. Pin 6 (VDD/NC) left open - CHECK datasheet.\nC2/C3 values (1 uF) are defaults - CHECK datasheet."
    (at 20 20 0)
    (effects
